    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_first_01",
      "hash64": "7E7F64259EA67512",
      "text": "Kofu, the Surging Chef, here to deliver yer order![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "333148F874699013",
      "text": "Vaultin’ Veluza! Fancy runnin’ into you again![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "333147F874698E60",
      "text": "Yer still a student, ain’tcha? Yet here you are,\\ngettin’ to invite special coaches and everything![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "33314AF874699379",
      "text": "Yer really somethin’ else, kid![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "6CA96FE2386E07BF",
      "text": "Yep, I’m somethin’ else!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "6CA970E2386E0972",
      "text": "It’s not that big of a deal...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "333149F8746991C6",
      "text": "Gahaha! You’ve got the confidence to match yer\\nstrength, I see! What a great catch indeed![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "6652552DCF6279AC",
      "text": "Gahaha! What’s the point of denyin’ that a big\\ndeal’s a big deal?! Bein’ humble only goes so\\r\\nfar, kid![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "33314CF8746996DF",
      "text": "Anyway, thanks for givin’ me the chance to come\\nall the way out here![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "33314BF87469952C",
      "text": "Ol’ man Kofu’s gonna learn somethin’ along with\\nthe kids, lemme tell ya![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "5DAF5EED2B0105C4",
      "text": "This place is great, surrounded by the sea an’ all.\\nCan’t imagine a better location![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "5DAF5FED2B010777",
      "text": "Feelin’ the sea breeze puts a bit o’ spring in my\\nstep—in my Pokémon’s, too![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "5DAF60ED2B01092A",
      "text": "That bein’ said, I couldn’t help but notice there’s\\na lack of seafood on the cafeteria menu...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "5DAF61ED2B010ADD",
      "text": "Don’t ya think it’d make the students here happy\\nif they could eat their fill of seafood, freshly\\r\\nbrought in from the ocean on their doorstep?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "DCDC33941635FF0E",
      "text": "I bet they’d love it!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "DCDC32941635FD5B",
      "text": "I think the menu’s fine as is...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "5DAF5AED2B00FEF8",
      "text": "Excellent! Now that I got yer endorsement, it’s\\ntime fer ol’ man Kofu to work his magic![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "31F61B0012B09FAE",
      "text": "I can understand wantin’ junk food now an’ then,\\nbut variety is the spice o’ life, as they say![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "5DAF5BED2B0100AB",
      "text": "Just you wait—the fingerlings here need a proper\\nmeal, and Kofu Lounge is gonna provide it![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "060394E58E8282B5",
      "text": "There ya are! I’ve got some news that’s sure to\\nrock yer boat![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "060393E58E828102",
      "text": "This ol’ man’s managed to land a collaboration\\nbetween the Kofu Lounge and the Blueberry\\r\\nAcademy cafeteria![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "B93707623A53FE51",
      "text": "That’s amazing!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "B93704623A53F938",
      "text": "I can’t wait!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "060392E58E827F4F",
      "text": "’Course, we only just settled on the deal. It’ll\\ntake some time ’fore things really get goin’![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "060391E58E827D9C",
      "text": "My first order o’ business is to rework the Kofu\\nLounge’s House Special Hot Pot a bit—make it\\r\\nmore suited to the students here![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "060390E58E827BE9",
      "text": "Growin’ kids deserve the best food, after all![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "06038FE58E827A36",
      "text": "Heh—lookit ol’ Kofu. I was just doin’ what came\\nnaturally, and now here I am teachin’ nutrition![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "DE6D182A49C40B17",
      "text": "What a catch! Thanks to yer callin’ me here, I get\\nto learn alongside the kids![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "DE6D172A49C40964",
      "text": "I’m in your debt, kid! Gahaha![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "DE6D1A2A49C40E7D",
      "text": "Whaddya say we go with the flow and trade\\nPokémon while we’re here, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "DE6D192A49C40CCA",
      "text": "Gahaha! Well, I’ll be lettin’ loose my Veluza!\\nHow ’bout you, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "DE6D142A49C4044B",
      "text": "A lively [VAR 0x0101(0001)]! What a great catch!\\c\\nDon’t you worry—this ol’ man’s gonna take real\\ngood care of this darlin’![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "DCC54E25225A79A8",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]You wanna trade your [VAR 0x0101(0001)] for my\\nVeluza?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "DCC54F25225A7B5B",
      "text": "You can’t trade Kofu a Pokémon if you aren’t its\\noriginal Trainer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "DCC55025225A7D0E",
      "text": "You can’t trade Kofu such a rare Pokémon!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "DCC55125225A7EC1",
      "text": "You can’t trade Kofu a Shiny Pokémon!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "07434419D8F1B8F9",
