      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "B2C57276E7E2D0AD",
      "text": "I am Kofu the Torrent! Ever changin’—just like\\nwater! And you can’t even fathom my depths\\r\\njust yet! Gahahahaha![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
