    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "0AC0F39213BEA636",
      "text": "Lemme tell ya, gettin’ a chance to work with\\nstudents has been a real learnin’ experience!\\c\\nYou’ve got no idea how many cool new poses\\nI’ve picked up! What a haul![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
